The bundled mascot face examples in this folder are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0. You may copy, modify, redistribute and use them,
including commercially, without asking permission and without attribution.

Covered files:
- `*-pack.png` and `*-visemes.png` (talking-face atlases)
- `*-talk.mp4` (example lipsync clips)
- `neutral-vowels.wav` (synthetic vowels)

Not covered:
- `/examples/tv-head-humanoid.glb` (separate bundled rig)

